The protocol HLV-204-201 (VASCLEAR-2), the drug Vasclarin (VSC-9), the sponsor and all
data are fictional. Guidelines and standards (ICH M11, ICH E6(R3), CDISC CDASH, SDTM and
Controlled Terminology) are named for education; descriptions are summaries, not regulatory
advice. No commercial EDC system is reproduced. The app is not a validated system, its
signatures are practice signatures, and it must not hold real study data. Everything stays
in the browser.

The study definition, check language and evaluation engine are shared with the CDM Query &
Edit-Check Console by the same author (Apache License 2.0).

